# Screens

Read the matching section of `docs/03_MODULES_AND_SCREENS.md` before writing a page. Copy heading, columns, filter defaults, empty-state wording and row actions from it. Do not add a column it does not list.

Pages are Server Components. `'use client'` only for FilterBar, DataTable pager, HeaderToggles, forms, ConfirmDialog.

FilterBar always has Apply, Clear, Reload, in that order. Reload is `router.refresh()`, not a full page reload. Clear restores the documented default status.

Every screen has Loading, Empty, Error, Success and Forbidden. A missing empty state is a bug.

Interim look: Tailwind `zinc` chrome only, no gradients, no new CSS files, no hex in a page. `docs/09_FRONTEND.md` section 5.

A screen is not done until `docs/03_MODULES_AND_SCREENS.md` section 6 is true.
